{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dumbass Survivors is a time survival game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements.<br>Hell is empty, the devils are here, and there's no place to run or hide. All you can do is survive as long as you can until a giant blue blob inevitably puts an end to your struggles.<br><br><i>The supernatural indie phenomenon that lets you be the bullet hell!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Starting Tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab coins as fast as possible, they won't disappear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You only get one weapon but it's a strong one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sooner your Dumbass is self-sufficient, the sooner you can go have fun on your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every Dumbass is different.\u00a0 All of them are woefully incompetent</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715520?t=1748370915","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715520?t=1748370915","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715520/ef801f6de08c6c19eab4d350162f15cfa7081513/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748370915","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715520/ef801f6de08c6c19eab4d350162f15cfa7081513/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748370915","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dumbass Survivors is a time survival game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements.<br>Hell is empty, the devils are here, and there's no place to run or hide. All you can do is survive as long as you can until a giant blue blob inevitably puts an end to your struggles.<br><br><i>The supernatural indie phenomenon that lets you be the bullet hell!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Starting Tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab coins as fast as possible, they won't disappear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You only get one weapon but it's a strong one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sooner your Dumbass is self-sufficient, the sooner you can go have fun on your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every Dumbass is different.\u00a0 All of them are woefully incompetent</p></li></ul>","developers":["IRateBurritos"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715520/9417c4080b1f1bee4fa87a31cd7e7a47ccd83fc9/header.jpg?t=1748370915","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  macOS 10.14 (Mojave) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel x64<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 125 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140769,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140769/movie480.mp4?t=1747764970","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140769/movie_max.mp4?t=1747764970"},"name":"Main Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140769/db7b06077ad85a992e9c3c55492184c828d9f2c9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747764970","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140769/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747764970","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140769/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747764970"}}],"name":"Dumbass Survivors","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum